  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The constant term in the expansion of<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1080",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Any term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now for term to be independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we know</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the term independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1080</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
